<DocsExample TExample="WizardBasicExample" Title="Steps and navigation" Description="NTWizardStep holds the content of one step. Next Step and Previous Step move between steps, and the last step offers Submit. A wizard fills its container's height, so these previews give it a fixed one." />
<DocsExample TExample="WizardFormStepExample" Title="Validated form steps" Description="NTWizardFormStep wraps an NTForm. Next is blocked until the step's DataAnnotations validation passes." />
<DocsExample TExample="WizardOptionalStepExample" Title="Optional steps" Description="Optional steps can be skipped, and OnStepSkipped reports which step was skipped." />
<DocsExample TExample="WizardBoundStepExample" Title="Bound active step" Description="Bind ActiveStepIndex to drive the wizard from code, and use NavigationMode to let people jump between step indicators." />
